      "title": "Add simulation requirements for task PR submissions",
      "author": "Inphi",
      "number": 1357,
      "body": "This PR contains some improvements to ensure that task underwriters are following the best practices. These include the following:\r\n\r\n- Update docs/NEW_TASK_GUIDE.md with \"Before Submitting Your Task for Review\" section requiring task authors to run and understand Tenderly simulations before opening PRs\r\n- Add task-specific PR template with simulation checklist\r\n- Add general PR template for non-task changes\r\n- Add CI workflow that validates simulation checklist is completed for PRs touching src/tasks/",
